efore applying makeup, she used a liquid _______ to create an even skin tone. <em>(alapoz\u00f3 \/ sminkalap)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">alap \/ alap\u00edtv\u00e1ny \/ alapoz\u00f3<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): tet\u0151 \/ v\u00e9g \/ rombol\u00e1s<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a strong _______ = er\u0151s alap (pl. A strong _______ is crucial for any building.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 lay the _______ for something = lerakja valaminek az alapjait (pl. The early research laid the _______ for future discoveries.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 research _______ = kutat\u00e1si alap\u00edtv\u00e1ny (pl. He received a grant from a research _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 make-up _______ = sminkalapoz\u00f3 (pl. She applied make-up _______ before her concealer.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>foundation<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>foundational<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>foundation<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>found<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: solid foundation \/ strong foundation \/ establish a foundation \/ charitable foundation<\/span><\/p><p>similar: base \/ basis \/ bedrock \/ groundwork<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: superstructure \/ culmination \/ demolition<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"foundation","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":2,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-03","reviewed_on":"2026-06-04","due_at":"2026-06-04T13:14:53+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-03T16:44:49+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-03","reviewed_on":"2026-06-03"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"4